{
  "_comment": [
    "The port reservation resolvd's stub listener needs: tcp,udp:53, granted",
    "to SYSTEM and to resolvd's own service SID,",
    "  S-1-5-80-3864064249-1823296737-2008945602-1354971773-2894779966",
    "so that the reservation follows the service rather than the account it",
    "happens to run as. A more specific selector than the kernel package's",
    "tcp,udp:1-1023, so it wins for port 53 alone (<pkm/net.h>).",
    "",
    "Regenerate with tools/gen-port-seed.py; do not hand-edit the hex.",
    "Shipped by the resolvd package into /usr/share/regim/; inert until an",
    "image names it in [registry] autoapply."
  ],
